  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LONGITUDNAL RESEARCH ON HEALTH &amp; WELLBEING</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Qualitative Longitudinal Research will Build on over 20 years of impactful research and policy engagement, it will focus on young people&#x2019;s health and wellbeing in Ethiopia. It will provide vital insights into how young people&#x2019;s lives are changing as they navigate multiple intersecting crises, including the impacts of COVID-19, conflict, climate change (notably recent severe droughts), and high inflation, and how these crises have affected their health and wellbeing and that of their children.</narrative>
  </description>
